{"ticker":"PGR","updated":"2026-10-30T23:05:52Z","profile":{"longName":"The Progressive Corporation","shortName":"Progressive Corporation (The)","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.progressive.com","fullTimeEmployees":70053,"marketCap":134026764288,"trailingPE":11.651385,"forwardPE":14.193598,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.4615946,"pegRatio":70.26,"targetMeanPrice":230.38095,"targetHighPrice":262.0,"targetLowPrice":196.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.03,"earningsGrowth":-0.021,"grossMargins":0.1728,"operatingMargins":0.14333999,"profitMargins":0.12674,"totalRevenue":91699003392,"beta":0.235,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":239.38,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":189.2,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.17},"summary":"The Progressive Corporation operates as an insurance company in the United States. It writes insurance for personal autos and special lines products, including motorcycles, RVs, and watercraft; and personal residential property insurance for homeowners and renters. The company also writes auto-related liability and physical damage insurance for comprising dump trucks, log trucks, garbage trucks, tractors, trailers, straight trucks, tow trucks and wreckers, vans, pick-up trucks, and autos; business-related general liability and commercial property insurance for small businesses; and workers' compensation insurance for the transportation industry. In addition, it offers other specialty property-casualty insurance and provides related services; personal property reinsurance products; and involved in investment activities. It sells its products through independent insurance agencies, as well as online and over the phone. The Progressive Corporation was founded in 1937 and is headquartered in Mayfield, Ohio.","summary_zh":"Progressive Corporation 在美國作為一家保險公司運作。它為個人汽車和特殊產品（包括摩托車、房車和船隻）承保；以及針對房主和租屋者的個人住宅財產保險。該公司還為自卸車、原木車、垃圾車、牽引車、拖車、直掛車、拖車和清障車、貨車、皮卡車和汽車承保與汽車相關的責任和人身損害保險；小型企業的商業一般責任保險和商業財產保險；以及運輸業的工傷賠償保險。此外，也提供其他專業財產傷亡保險並提供相關服務；個人財產再保險產品；並參與投資活動。它透過獨立保險機構以及線上和電話銷售其產品。 Progressive Corporation 成立於 1937 年，總部位於俄亥俄州梅菲爾德。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":247.91,"h":247.91,"l":244.81,"c":245.86,"v":2353100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":244.71,"h":247.62,"l":243.25,"c":246.72,"v":2581900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":248.37,"h":249.83,"l":247.44,"c":249.01,"v":2004700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":248.74,"h":249.0,"l":242.87,"c":243.86,"v":1690800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":243.5,"h":246.48,"l":240.15,"c":245.94,"v":2611900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":245.69,"h":245.75,"l":241.91,"c":243.26,"v":2849400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":242.41,"h":246.63,"l":240.5,"c":246.41,"v":2170500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":246.73,"h":249.11,"l":245.18,"c":248.8,"v":1647300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":248.75,"h":249.71,"l":247.67,"c":248.28,"v":2612100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":248.01,"h":249.14,"l":244.93,"c":245.65,"v":2944400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":243.72,"h":245.56,"l":241.03,"c":244.97,"v":2835700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":241.0,"h":243.9,"l":239.2,"c":243.61,"v":3363100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":243.43,"h":244.83,"l":240.69,"c":242.0,"v":3366000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":241.29,"h":243.59,"l":241.08,"c":242.34,"v":4783400},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":241.84,"h":242.18,"l":239.25,"c":241.15,"v":2330300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":240.74,"h":241.03,"l":237.14,"c":238.61,"v":3971700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":238.0,"h":240.5,"l":236.75,"c":240.0,"v":2812500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":241.12,"h":242.43,"l":238.59,"c":242.19,"v":2832400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":243.99,"h":245.61,"l":241.72,"c":243.48,"v":2888900},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":244.52,"h":244.88,"l":241.86,"c":244.4,"v":2911900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":244.41,"h":247.09,"l":244.22,"c":246.95,"v":2396700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":245.84,"h":248.17,"l":245.0,"c":246.46,"v":2441800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":244.45,"h":245.71,"l":242.22,"c":243.5,"v":2495600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":242.12,"