agmented Insurance Chatbot Market","src":"EIN News","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"國際商業機器公司持有 4% 份額，引領適度分散的保險聊天機器人市場"},{"title":"Quarterly profit fell 3% at Progressive (PGR), despite a September earnings jump.","src":"Stock Titan","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOVkRZT2JOM0dwZnNGNjRyQmdrTFVRYnlELWFER1h3S21kT0RLWjkxVmxhWUNEbllENWFiYlJzcHRraGd3bGVSV2Q2cGdSeDFBai1HWVlIRnJ5V2U1T0pTcjFFSzdBeUdNdWluTGROT0FjTEZ6YUNSR2lFTXJza0plRmpseFJnLW5QTHdtRW9qQTI4UzduMUdHb1A0MTgwLUpwMEFCcVY0RTlMeTg?oc=5","date":"2026-10-14","zh":"儘管 9 月獲利大幅成長，但 Progressive (PGR) 的季度利潤仍下降 3%。"}],"themes":[{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/80661/000008066126000086/pgr-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Progressive Corporation, an insurance holding company, has insurance and non-insurance subsidiaries and affiliates (references in this Item to subsidiaries include affiliates as well). Our insurance subsidiaries write personal and commercial auto insurance, personal residential property insurance, and insurance for motorcycles, watercraft, and other recreational vehicles. We also offer business-related general liability and commercial property insurance predominantly for small businesses, workers' compensation insurance primarily for the transportation industry, and other specialty property-casualty insurance and provide related services. Our non-insurance subsidiaries generally support our insurance and investment operations. We operate throughout the United States. Unless noted, references to \"state(s)\" throughout this report include the District of Columbia. The Progressive Corpor","zh":"Progressive Corporation 是一家保險控股公司，擁有保險和非保險子公司和附屬公司（本條中提及的子公司也包括附屬公司）。我們的保險子公司承保個人和商業汽車保險、個人住宅財產保險以及摩托車、船舶和其他休閒車輛保險。我們也主要為小型企業提供與商業相關的一般責任保險和商業財產保險、主要為運輸業提供的工傷賠償保險以及其他專業財產傷亡保險並提供相關服務。我們的非保險子公司通常支持我們的保險和投資業務。我們的業務遍及美國各地。除非另有說明，本報告中提及的「州」包括哥倫比亞特區。進步公司"},{"en":"Progressive's vision is to become consumers', agents', and business owners' number one destination for insurance and other financial needs. Progressive's four strategic pillars of people and culture, broad needs of our customers, leading brand, and competitive prices serve as the foundation of how we will achieve our vision.","zh":"Progressive 的願景是成為消費者、代理商和企業主滿足保險和其他金融需求的第一目的地。 Progressive 的四大策略支柱：人員和文化、客戶的廣泛需求、領先的品牌和具有競爭力的價格，是我們實現願景的基礎。"},{"en":"Our Chief Executive Officer (CEO) assesses performance and makes key operating decisions for our insurance, investment, and service operations and is supported by the following management team that oversees the business and corporate functions that support all areas of our organization.","zh":"我們的執行長 (CEO) 評估績效並為我們的保險、投資和服務營運做出關鍵營運決策，並得到以下管理團隊的支持，該團隊負責監督支持我們組織所有領域的業務和企業職能。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We offer our commercial auto products in all states, excluding the District of Columbia. Our commercial auto customers insure approximately two vehicles per policy, excluding large fleet policies. During 2025, we wrote about 90% of our commercial auto business through the agency channel, excluding transportation network company (TNC) business, which is all written through the direct channel.","zh":"我們在所有州（哥倫比亞特區除外）提供者用汽車產品。我們的商用汽車客戶每份保單大約為兩輛車投保，不包括大型車隊保單。 2025年，我們約90%的商用車業務透過代理通路承銷，不包括運輸網路公司（TNC）業務，全部透過直營通路承銷。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{},"peers":["ALL","CB","MRSH","HIG","TRV"]}}